Task: 21
Title: Stage 9–10 agent types (Verify and Report)
Phase: 4
Route: full
Slice: Slice 4a — Verify + Report
Dependencies: None
Scope: Convert the four Stage 9–10 agent types: `qrspi-verify` (orchestrator — dispatches verifier, runs final verification pass), `qrspi-verifier` (executes comprehensive verification against all acceptance criteria), `qrspi-report` (orchestrator — dispatches reporter, collects final metrics), and `qrspi-reporter` (produces stage10-summary.md and metrics-summary.md). All use pi agent type convention. The verifier is medium-thinking; others are low-thinking.
Acceptance Criteria: AC 6 (Stage 9–10 agent types), AC 7 (model tier frontmatter)
NFRs: NFR: Compatibility (model tier)
Gate Criteria: Phase 4 replan gate (Verify + Report agents complete)
